    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a few minutes though. it's been like 6 hours and some people can see the new site but others are getting the old one or just straight up timeouts. it feels like the data is just... disappearing or getting lost somewhere in the middle. is there something actually happening to the packets or is it just sitting in a cache somewhere?",
